    "affected_model": "GradientBoosting",
    "description": "GradientBoosting's per-fold MAE differs from the thesis-committed results/experiment_1_scores.csv on 8 of 30 folds (splits 5, 7, 8, 11, 12, 17, 23, 26), with a maximum single-fold absolute difference of 0.019 years. This shifts GradientBoosting's aggregate MAE from the thesis-reported 2.5123 [2.1867, 2.8380] to 2.5109 [2.1854, 2.8365] (and correspondingly small shifts in RMSE, R2, and every Wilcoxon row involving GradientBoosting).",
